Resident is a macOS menu bar utility. It links only against system frameworks
shipped with macOS (AppKit, Foundation, Metal, IOKit) and the platform's own
libproc/sysctl interfaces. It vendors no third-party source and has no package
dependencies. Where the `lms` command-line tool from LM Studio is installed,
Resident runs it to read model activity; it is not bundled.

Sister project to Handler (https://github.com/Don-Works/handler), which watches
the resource ceilings that take the whole machine down.
